 "description": "Per-track momentum scale and extra resolution for MC, fitted jointly to the mass peaks of Ds -> phi(KK) pi, J/psi -> mu mu (in B+ -> J/psi K+) and B+ -> J/psi K+ (refitted J/psi + K) in data.",
 "apply_to": "MC only, every charged track used in the analysis (kaons, pion, muon). Data are not corrected. Muon tracks use per_bin_muon for the terms a2, c2 and per_bin for the others.",
